{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-7","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量与比例","englishTitle":"Incommensurable magnitudes have not to one another the ratio which a number has to a number.","book":10,"number":7,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.7","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.7/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":7,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-7@raw-0f12ed8107008ac4","contentId":"euclid-10-7","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f12ed8107008ac41f983489edb864dcb5d3d31083e4d57f2176c6316e3a57b9","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-7.statement","euclid-10-7.construction.1","euclid-10-7.proof.1","euclid-10-7.proof.2","euclid-10-7.conclusion","euclid-10-7.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-7.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-7","revisionId":"euclid-10-7@raw-0f12ed8107008ac4","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d53d01d9a9cc1120d20b3fb215aa8e34f3bd20b5762c9ed135d4ffe33744901d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Incommensurable magnitudes have not to one another the ratio which a number has to a number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"不可公度级的数值之间没有一数字与一数字的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-7.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-7","revisionId":"euclid-10-7@raw-0f12ed8107008ac4","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"131fe0c95860adcb043ddc663de873f94d1aaa0a25685f202b222810d8debf96","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be incommensurable magnitudes; I say that A has not to B the ratio which a number has to a number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B是不可公度级;我说,A比B比,数字比不到B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-7.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-7","revisionId":"euclid-10-7@raw-0f12ed8107008ac4","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a65c03989ce9be694524fb5cc36d3ba8c571aee26def49cf6b40e44446430fdf","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if A has to B the ratio which a number has to a number, A will be commensurable with B. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果A达到B,数字就达到A,B将达到可公度。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-7.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-7","revisionId":"euclid-10-7@raw-0f12ed8107008ac4","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a5aafb605dc8013fe59d1648d5ffd7ad1673d72d783ce827a94e51392c58f3eb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is not; therefore A has not to B the ratio which a number has to a number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但情况并非如此;因此,A的比例没有达到B,而数字是B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-7.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-7","revisionId":"euclid-10-7@raw-0f12ed8107008ac4","order":4,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-7.source","contentId":"euclid-10-7","revisionId":"euclid-10-7@raw-0f12ed8107008ac4","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cddd1dbd6e8491d7bb533f27e2e06bf563c4a30373993170be1265f4436eeb52","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.7/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.7\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-7:euclid-10-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-7.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.7/","sourceLabel":"X. 6"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-11:euclid-10-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-11.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.11/","sourceLabel":"X. 7"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-7:euclid-10-6:explicit","id":"euclid-10-6","book":10,"number":6,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与比例与整数","provenance":"explicit_source_